xi  it looks like ubisoft has a big problem  on their hands that  seems like it isn't going away anytime  soon  if if this happened to me i would not  handle it well  i i've never once been banned in siege  okay  cs go all right fair enough i don't play  a lot of siege  i've been banned a bunch in cs go but  like  if you want to see me toxic have this  situation happen to me  i would lose my [ __ ] mind it would  not be it would not be good

